      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just kinda scared to go to the er if it's just a migraine... it's really expensive and the waits are crazy. but the arm weakness is weird. do u think it's actually dangerous or could it just be part of the aura making me feel lightheaded? like is there anything i can take right now to make it go away so i can just sleep it off?",
